<guid>https://tiktok.com/embed/7685861448815316254</guid>
<description>
<![CDATA[I’m genuinely surprised that this worked 😂 my main concern was that the air was gonna break up the water and just push past it and come out the pipe. I did this test at 50 psi and it blasted it out like a jet. I imagine I could probably play with that and go lower or higher and it might give different results. But the point is it definitely works in the solar powered off grid automatic irrigation. Well can be winterized in about five minutes, which is incredible because as you guys know, I’m all about efficiency!<br>#diy
#fyp
#solar
#homestead
